{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115085233400-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115091837\"/><p>濃煙攻出走廊。</p><p>黃大仙發生火警。今晨(15日)8時47分，黃大仙下邨龍光樓一單位發生火警，一度傳出爆炸聲。現場濃煙滾滾，攻出走廊，驚動多人報案。消防員接報到場，派出一隊煙帽隊開喉灌救，同時搜救隊到場協助救援。事件中，約50人疏散。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T01:33:21.535835+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T00:52:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T01:26:47.992842+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T01:26:47.992842+00:00","content_hash":"5fe44e2aa99440af6c5c42b619783506c416dca3d297a7ac819736b9921e088c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}